# Godot client

Details: `docs/engineering/godot.md`. Contract: TZ §10–11.

Typed GDScript, 2D. Godot displays projections; it does not own inventory, money, or outcomes. Mono editor ≠ C#.

```gdscript
# BAD
get_node("../../HUD/Gold").text = str(gold)
GameState.gold += 10

# GOOD
trade_panel.trade_offered.connect(_on_trade_offered)
gold_label.text = str(projection.player_gold)
```

Do: Main / World / GUI; parent injects deps; call down, signal up; InputMap; `_physics_process` for physics, `_process` for frames; duplicate Resources for per-entity runtime state.

Don't: Autoload world/EventBus; hard NodePaths across scenes; mutate shared `.tres`; use frame `delta` as sim time; parent the player to a disposable room; AnimationPlayer as the only outcome path.
